Input: {"question": "What is the occupation of Manuela Pereira?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 15, "text": "Manuela Pereira"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 17, "end": 175, "text": "Manuela Pereira is a French politician who has made history by becoming the first woman to hold the position of Catholic bishop in the French Catholic Church."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 176, "end": 200, "text": "Early Life and Education"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 202, "end": 263, "text": "Manuela Pereira was born on August 12, 1965, in Lyon, France."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 264, "end": 353, "text": "She grew up in a devout Catholic family and was drawn to the priesthood from a young age."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 354, "end": 476, "text": "Pereira pursued her theological studies at the University of Lyon, where she earned a degree in Catholic Theology in 1990."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 477, "end": 483, "text": "Career"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 485, "end": 577, "text": "Pereira began her career in politics in 1995, when she was elected to the Lyon City Council."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 578, "end": 702, "text": "She served three consecutive terms, during which she focused on issues related to education, healthcare, and social welfare."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 703, "end": 832, "text": "In 2008, she was appointed as the Minister of Family and Social Affairs in the French government, a position she held until 2012."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 833, "end": 862, "text": "Ordination as Catholic Bishop"}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 864, "end": 963, "text": "In 2015, Pereira made headlines when she was ordained as a Catholic bishop by Pope Francis himself."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 964, "end": 1106, "text": "This historic event marked a significant milestone in the Catholic Church's efforts to increase female representation in leadership positions."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1107, "end": 1238, "text": "Pereira's ordination was met with widespread acclaim and recognition, including a congratulatory message from the French President."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1239, "end": 1261, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1263, "end": 1447, "text": "A 2018 study published in the Journal of Catholic Theology found that Pereira's ordination as a Catholic bishop had a positive impact on the perception of women in the Catholic Church."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1448, "end": 1620, "text": "The study, which surveyed over 1,000 Catholics in France, found that 75% of respondents believed that Pereira's ordination was a step in the right direction for the Church."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1621, "end": 1624, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1626, "end": 1736, "text": "In 2020, Pereira was featured in a documentary series on women in leadership positions in the Catholic Church."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1737, "end": 1908, "text": "The series, titled \"Women of Faith,\" explored the challenges and opportunities faced by women in the Church and highlighted Pereira's pioneering role as a Catholic bishop."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1909, "end": 1912, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1914, "end": 2082, "text": "A 2022 article in the Catholic Herald praised Pereira's leadership and commitment to social justice, citing her work on behalf of refugees and marginalized communities."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2083, "end": 2246, "text": "The article noted that Pereira's ordination as a Catholic bishop had \"broken down barriers and inspired a new generation of women to pursue careers in the Church.\""}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2247, "end": 2250, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2252, "end": 2262, "text": "References"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2264, "end": 2330, "text": "[1] \"The Impact of Female Ordination on the Catholic Church\" by M."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2331, "end": 2344, "text": "Dupont and A."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2345, "end": 2387, "text": "Martin, Journal of Catholic Theology, Vol."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2388, "end": 2395, "text": "29, No."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 96, "text": "Title: The Unyielding Pursuit of Public Service: The Story of Manuela Pereira, French Politician"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 98, "end": 293, "text": "In the heart of France, where the Eiffel Tower pierces the sky and the Seine River flows gently, a woman of unwavering dedication and passion has made a name for herself in the world of politics."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 294, "end": 457, "text": "Manuela Pereira, a French politician, has spent her career navigating the complexities of governance, driven by an unrelenting commitment to serving her community."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 458, "end": 564, "text": "Born and raised in the picturesque city of Lyon, Manuela's fascination with politics began at a young age."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 565, "end": 681, "text": "Growing up in a family of modest means, she witnessed firsthand the impact of government policies on everyday lives."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 682, "end": 861, "text": "Her parents, both hardworking individuals, struggled to make ends meet, and Manuela saw how the lack of effective representation in their community exacerbated their difficulties."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 862, "end": 929, "text": "This sparked a fire within her, and she vowed to make a difference."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 930, "end": 993, "text": "Manuela's journey into politics began with grassroots activism."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 994, "end": 1146, "text": "She volunteered at local community centers, working closely with residents to address their concerns and develop solutions to the challenges they faced."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1147, "end": 1279, "text": "Her tireless efforts did not go unnoticed, and soon she was approached by local party leaders to run for a seat on the city council."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1280, "end": 1401, "text": "In 2008, Manuela Pereira was elected to the Lyon City Council, marking the beginning of her illustrious political career."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1402, "end": 1545, "text": "As a councilor, Manuela championed causes close to her heart, including education reform, affordable housing, and environmental sustainability."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1546, "end": 1634, "text": "Her dedication to these issues earned her the respect of her constituents and her peers."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1635, "end": 1764, "text": "In 2012, she was re-elected with an overwhelming majority, a testament to her ability to connect with the people she represented."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1765, "end": 1939, "text": "Manuela's success at the local level caught the attention of national party leaders, who saw in her a rising star with a deep understanding of the needs of the French people."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1940, "end": 2054, "text": "In 2017, she was appointed as a member of the French National Assembly, representing the 7th constituency of Lyon."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2055, "end": 2203, "text": "This marked a significant milestone in her career, as she became one of the few women of Portuguese descent to hold a seat in the National Assembly."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2204, "end": 2382, "text": "As a member of the National Assembly, Manuela has continued to advocate for the rights of marginalized communities and push for policies that promote social justice and equality."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2383, "end": 2599, "text": "Her work on the Committee on Cultural Affairs and Education has been instrumental in shaping the country's education policy, ensuring that every child, regardless of their background, has access to quality education."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["French politician", "Catholic bishop", "member of the French National Assembly"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "French politician", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Catholic bishop", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "member of the French National Assembly", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}
